// The Admin service.
//
// ADR-0003 keeps Admin on the same endpoint and the same protocol as Game:
// andara-cli has no privileged back door and no direct datastore access, and
// an operator action goes through the same wire as a player's (CLAUDE.md §10).
// Restricting Admin *reachability* at the network layer is compatible with
// that and is an AW-INF-006 decision, still open.
//
// Deliberately minimal. The operator surface — inspect, intervene, snapshot,
// content publish — belongs to the stories that implement each one, and
// inventing RPCs here would assign permanent method names to guesses.

